When explaining anything use plain language, short sentences, and avoid dense or overly compressed phrasing.
  considering following simplified technical english

The compaction job holds an advisory lock for the whole run, which is fine at today's volume.
  it stops being fine once a second runner needs the same partition.

A capitalised continuation is left alone because it might genuinely be a new sentence.
  Considering following simplified technical english

Short line.
considering this stays put because the previous line is under the threshold

